# Test rules

Read before editing `e2e/`, `src/Backend/Tests/`, or `tools/e2e/`:

- Hub: `docs/test/README.md`
- Run locally: `docs/test/ONBOARDING.md`
- Inventory: `docs/test/TEST_CATALOG.md`
- Fixtures / ports / auth: `docs/test/ARCHITECTURE.md`
- Add tests: `docs/test/EXTENSIBILITY_GUIDE.md`
- Full AI checklist: `docs/test/LLM_FEATURE_IMPLEMENTATION_RULES.md`

## Two layers

| Layer | Path | When to use |
|-------|------|-------------|
| API integration | `src/Backend/Tests/Api.IntegrationTests` | HTTP, auth, DB, admin APIs |
| Playwright | `e2e/tests/` | UI smoke, routing, forms |

Run: `./tools/e2e/run-api-integration.sh` · `./tools/e2e/run-playwright.sh`

## Playwright auth (non-negotiable)

- **Frontend:** `storageState` from `frontend/auth.setup.ts` (tokens in localStorage)
- **Admin:** `beforeEach(loginAdminConsole())` — **no** `storageState` (JWT in Zustand memory)

## Environment defaults

- API: `http://localhost:5076` (`E2E_API_URL`) — avoid macOS `:5000` (AirPlay)
- FE: `:3000` · Admin: `:5174`
- Credentials: `admin@localhost.com` / `Temp!ChangeMe123`
- DataProtection: `local/dataprotection-keys` for e2e API webServer

Login 500 / `EncryptedColumnDecryptionException` → DB keys mismatch, not CORS. See `docs/test/ONBOARDING.md` troubleshooting.

## API integration

- Use `IntegrationTestApp`, `CapturingEmailSender`, `CustomWebApplicationFactory`
- Optional media: `INTEGRATION_MEDIA_ENABLED=true`
- Existing DB: `TEST_DATABASE_CONNECTION_STRING`

## Quality

- Minimal diff; no unrelated app refactors
- Update `docs/test/TEST_CATALOG.md` when adding scenarios
- Prefer `getByRole` / shared `login.ts` helpers in Playwright
- No secrets, no production DB/keys, no committed `test-results/`
